# deployments/send2ereader/.env.example — committed. Copy to .env, or let the play make it.
# This deployment has no secrets and nothing here to fill in: the tunnel play writes
# TUNNEL_ID and TUNNEL_CREDENTIALS into .env (creating it at 0600 if absent), and
# compose.yaml refuses to start until it has. The image is a literal in compose.yaml.
#
# An SRC_ROOT line left in an existing .env from when the app was built on the host is
# unused now and can be deleted.
